# welcome-fit-1920x1200 (h10-fit): the welcome page at fit 1 in a 1920 x 1200
# window (the paper filling a larger window, the composition centred), dark
# Arctic Ice, reduced motion.
route welcome
size 1920 1200
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
shot welcome-fit-1920x1200
